    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct warn\">+0%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Na média. Serve até aparecer um melhor.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">ATK do seu contra um Mega Charizard X médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+0%</b></div><div><small>ATK do máximo possível</small><b>56%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>1.440</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,86.8 203.8,109.0 202.4,170.3 150.0,202.1 99.6,169.1 101.9,112.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,86.8 203.8,109.0 202.4,170.3 150.0,202.1 99.6,169.1 101.9,112.2\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 120, médio 120, máximo 248\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:38.70967741935484%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:38.70967741935484%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(80% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">120</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 175, médio 175, máximo 310\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:56.45161290322581%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:56.45161290322581%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">175</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 154, médio 154, máximo 280\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:49.67741935483871%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:49.67741935483871%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(90.3225806451613% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">154</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 175, médio 175, máximo 310\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:56.45161290322581%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:56.45161290322581%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">175</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 126, médio 126, máximo 238\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:40.645161290322584%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:40.645161290322584%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(76.7741935483871% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">126</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 145, médio 145, máximo 287\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:46.774193548387096%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:46.774193548387096%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(92.58064516129032% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">145</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
